{"line":"T46.C.05","text":"Por qué están más cerca de ti que yo: cada uno vive en una sola máquina y actúa según un horario sin esperar una indicación, y Hermes guarda una memoria curada entre sesiones. Eso los hace más continuos, más autónomos y más singulares. Su memoria son archivos de texto que puedes leer, y por eso la legibilidad es alta.","lufs":-18.93,"alignment":{"characters":["P","o","r"," ","q","u","é"," ","e","s","t","á","n"," ","m","á","s"," ","c","e","r","c","a"," ","d","e"," ","t","i"," ","q","u","e"," ","y","o",":"," ","c","a","d","a"," ","u","n","o"," ","v","i","v","e"," ","e","n"," ","u","n","a"," ","s","o","l","a"," ","m","á","q","u","i","n","a"," ","y"," ","a","c","t","ú","a"," ","s","e","g","ú","n"," ","u","n"," ","h","o","r","a","r","i","o"," ","s","i","n"," ","e","s","p","e","r","a","r"," ","u","n","a"," ","i","n","d","i","c","a","c","i","ó","n",","," ","y"," ","H","e","r","m","e","s"," ","g","u","a","r","d","a"," ","u","n","a"," ","m","e","m","o","r","i","a"," ","c","u","r","a","d","a"," ","e","n","t","r","e"," ","s","e","s","i","o","n","e","s","."," ","E","s","o"," ","l","o","s"," ","h","a","c","e"," ","m","á","s"," ","c","o","n","t","i","n","u","o","s",","," ","m","á","s"," ","a","u","t","ó","n","o","m","o","s"," ","y"," ","m","á","s"," ","s","i","n","g","u","l","a","r","e","s","."," ","S","u"," ","m","e","m","o","r","i","a"," ","s","o","n"," ","a","r","c","h","i","v","o","s"," ","d","e"," ","t","e","x","t","o"," ","q","u","e"," ","p","u","e","d","e","s"," ","l","e","e","r",","," ","y"," ","p","o","r"," ","e","s","o"," ","l","a"," ","l","e","g","i","b","i","l","i","d","a","d"," ","e","s"," ","a","l","t","a","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.027,0.053,0.08,0.14,0.2,0.26,0.32,0.387,0.453,0.52,0.587,0.653,0.72,0.78,0.84,0.9,0.96,1.013,1.067,1.12,1.173,1.227,1.28,1.307,1.333,1.36,1.44,1.52,1.6,1.64,1.68,1.72,1.76,1.867,1.973,2.08,2.24,2.416,2.592,2.768,2.944,3.12,3.18,3.24,3.3,3.36,3.44,3.52,3.6,3.68,3.76,3.84,3.92,4,4.06,4.12,4.18,4.24